  "_pipelines": "The entries below belong to `--pipeline utility-bill` (regions_report.py § Pipelines): ONE POST /assess per bill with a single llm criterion (score: false, options.boxes: true) asking the vision model where the amount due is. Keys are `utility bill — where is the amount due? — <file name>` for the call itself (like any collection item) and `pipeline: utility bill — <file name>` for the localisation checks: box_accepted (the enforcement loop accepted a box) and amount_due_boxes_grid (every place the bill prints its amount due, hand-measured on the 0-1000 grid of the upright page; the accepted box must reach IoU >= 0.25 with at least one). An ad-hoc --document has no entries and its checks are recorded as skipped.",
